# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# RNG_clothing .gitignore
#
# Principle: git carries OUR code, docs, authored art and catalogue indexes.
# It does not carry (a) regenerable output, (b) third-party art corpora.
#
# (b) is deliberate on two grounds: size (the corpora are ~60MB of the 385MB
# tree) and redistribution -- `generator conent/` and `references/benchmark/`
# are other authors' Fashion Sense packs.  They are the SOURCE AUTHORITY for
# construction, so a second machine still needs them; `tools/corpus_manifest.py`
# records their hashes so any machine can prove it holds the same corpus
# without the repo republishing someone else's art.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Python / build
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
bin/
obj/

# Regenerable output and captures
output/
test-packs/
qc_bridge/captures/
qc_bridge/responses/
qc_bridge/requests/
qc_bridge/sessions/
reports/**/*.png

# Third-party art corpora -- see tools/corpus_manifest.py (SOURCE AUTHORITY,
# synced out of band, never republished from this repo)
generator conent/
references/benchmark/
references/ref_codex/
references/style-profiles/
references/lifestyle/
references/hoodie/
motif/
[FS] Jedone's Casual Hat Pack/

# Archives -- unpack, don't version
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar

# Local reference mirror of the installed game assembly: metadata index only,
# never the assembly or its content (that would redistribute game files)
references/stardew-official/assembly/

# Large loose reference sheets in root
sailorstyle_female.png
SAILORSTYLE_MALE.png
Screenshot_*.png

# Editor cruft
.*.kate-swp
*~

# Embedded upstream clone: the official Fashion Sense wiki, kept as a live git
# checkout so it can be `git pull`ed.  Not tracked here (a nested repo becomes
# a broken gitlink); re-clone with:
#   git clone https://github.com/Floogen/FashionSense.wiki.git \
#             references/fashion-sense-official/wiki-git
references/fashion-sense-official/wiki-git/
